# ---- PPDM schema: licensed, NOT redistributable ----
# PPDM Terms and Conditions cl.3: the model and its supporting material "are, and
# remain, the intellectual property of the PPDM with all rights reserved". Supply
# your own PPDM39_PG.zip (members' download) -- scripts/build_ppdm_schema.py
# regenerates sql/ppdm_min.sql from it. Both are ignored for the same reason:
# ppdm_min.sql embeds PPDM column definitions verbatim.
PPDM39_PG.zip
sql/ppdm_min.sql

# ---- model checkpoints & run outputs (regenerated) ----
models/*
!models/.gitkeep
# reports: the generated .md analyses ARE the deliverables -- track them.
# Anything bulky (figures, exports) stays out.
reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep
!reports/README.md
!reports/*.md

